IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. VULNPROG.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 INPUT-BUFFER    PIC X(10).
       01 TARGET-BUFFER   PIC X(5).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT INPUT-BUFFER FROM CONSOLE.
      * Vulnerability: Buffer Overflow / Unchecked String Copy
      * Copying a 10-byte string into a 5-byte target overflows adjacent memory
           STRING INPUT-BUFFER DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO TARGET-BUFFER
           END-STRING.
           DISPLAY "TARGET: " TARGET-BUFFER.
           STOP RUN.
